  "confirmDefaultTitle": "Which system starts by default",
  "confirmDefaultLead": "When you press the power button after a shutdown, this system starts. Restarting from Android always comes back to Android. If you mostly use Windows, choose Windows. You can change this later in Android under Settings → System → Startup options.",
